---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="about">
        <h5>Harbor</h5>
        <p>港湾——四个业余项目停泊的地方，也是我写字的地方。用 Astro 搭建，源码在 GitHub。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>导航</h5>
        <a href="/projects/">项目</a>
        <a href="/blog/">文章</a>
        <a href="/about/">关于</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>联系</h5>
        <a href="https://github.com/leo-yuxiangchao" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
        <!-- 防爬虫:静态站明文邮箱会被扫,用 [at] 写法 -->
        <span class="mail">15171122729 [at] 163.com</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bar">
      <span>© {year} LEO — HARBOR</span>
      <span>BUILT WITH ASTRO</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 92px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    padding: 34px 0 40px;
  }
  h5 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    color: var(--dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  p { margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 2; max-width: 34em; }
  a { display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 2.1; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .mail { display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 2.1; }
  .bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 18px 0 26px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    .bar { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
